## Branches

Format: `{{branch_pattern}}`

- Description in lowercase, words joined by `-`; no person names; no vague names (`fix-new`, `final-v2`, `test-branch`).
- Ticket IDs as the tracker writes them: {{ticket_prefixes}}. Without a ticket ID the user names the branch.
- The agent proposes the name; the user confirms or edits it.
- Release lines: `{{release_pattern}}`.

